# data/: the Kaggle datasets (licenses, file size), the files created by the scripts
# and the files with reviews copied by hand (texts written by hotel guests) stay off GitHub.
# Only the small files made by the team that contain no review texts are tracked.
data/*
!data/README.md
!data/Hotel_Database.xlsx
# models/: the trained models are small and tracked, so the report and the demo run
# without retraining. Recreate them with the scripts in src/ (see models/README.md).
models/*
!models/README.md
!models/topic_model.joblib
!models/sentiment_model.joblib
!models/impact_weights.csv
!models/impact_intercept.json

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
